      "source_id": 3,
      "title": "FF06B5 Ouroboros",
      "description": "The symbol was found in a hidden chamber at the bottom of a newly added location 'Destroyed Bastion'. It's visible on wall to the right after entering the chamber. The symbol clearly features the vampiric ouroboros but with some changes and added text.",
      "thumbnail_url": "Images/Thumbnail/191126b0-dc9e-4feb-861d-41d1f8689d07.jpg",
      "image_url": "Images/Full/191126b0-dc9e-4feb-861d-41d1f8689d07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "is_fact": true,
      "theory_id": 13,
      "sub_theory_id": 1,
      "source_id": 3,
      "title": "Tdet Tribe Symbol",
      "description": "This symbol is visible in both Tesham Mutna and Unseen Elder's cave. What's interesting here is that the symbol uses the exact same snake as on the vampiric ouroboros.",
      "thumbnail_url": "Images/Thumbnail/33bdacf3-2f6a-47c5-afba-34a21eff4aee.jpg",
      "image_url": "Images/Full/33bdacf3-2f6a-47c5-afba-34a21eff4aee.jpg"
    },
    {
