      "sub_theory_id": 1,
      "source_id": 3,
      "title": "Tesham Mutna 1",
      "description": "This symbol is visible in the chamber at the very bottom of Tesham Mutna. The symbol is partially covered by rubble and it's rather large so you can easily miss it. The chamber in which it was located was used as jail for vampire Khagmar.",
      "thumbnail_url": "Images/Thumbnail/bb2a2ec8-b5ee-4b68-9951-3e774b20b407.jpg",
      "image_url": "Images/Full/bb2a2ec8-b5ee-4b68-9951-3e774b20b407.jpg"
